#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:1
msgid "Deprecate classes/functions that use vtkAbstractArray::GetVoidPointer()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:3
msgid ""
"Several classes and methods have been deprecated to further reduce the usage "
"of `vtkAbstractArray::GetVoidPointer()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:5
msgid ""
"`vtkSMPContourGrid` has been deprecated. Use `vtkContourFilter` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:6
msgid ""
"`vtkSMPMergePoints` has been deprecated. Use `vtkStaticPointLocator` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:7
msgid ""
"`vtkSMPMergePolyDataHelper` has been deprecated. Use `vtkAppendPolyData` "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:8
msgid ""
"`vtkPoints(2D)::GetVoidPointer()` have been deprecated. Use `vtkPoints(2D)::"
"GetData()` along with `vtkArrayDispatch` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:10
msgid ""
"`vtkGenericDataArray::GetPointer()` has been deprecated. Use "
"`vtkArrayDispatch` and `vtk::DataArray(Tuple/Value)Range` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:12
msgid ""
"`vtk(Array/Points)Portal` have been deprecated because they are no longer "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:13
msgid ""
"`vtkAbstractArray::ExportToVoidPointer()` has been deprecated. Use DeepCopy "
"with an `vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:15
msgid ""
"`vtkAbstractArray::NewIterator()` along with `vtkArrayIterator`, "
"`vtkBitArrayIterator`, `vtkArrayIteratorTemplate` have been deprecated. Use "
"`vtk::DataArrayValueRange` or the array directly instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:17
msgid ""
"`vtkAbstractArray:WriterToVoidPointer()` has been deprecated. Use "
"`vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate::WriterPointer()` or `vtkAbstractArray::"
"SetNumberOf[Values/Tuples]()` instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:19
msgid "`vtkVoidArray` has been deprecated because it is no longer needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:20
msgid ""
"`vtkScaledSOADataArrayTemplate` has been deprecated because it is no longer "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:21
msgid ""
"`vtk(Angular)PeriodicDataArray` have been deprecated because they are no "
"longer needed since `vtkAngularPeriodicFilter` generates an implicit array "
"using an internally defined backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:23
msgid ""
"`vtkStdFunctionArray` has been deprecated because it is no longer needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:25
msgid ""
"Additionally, to further reduce the usage of `vtkAbstractArray::"
"GetVoidPointer()`, `vtk::DataArray(Value/Tuple)Range` have been extended to "
"support all concrete `vtkAbstractArray` subclasses, including `vtkBitArray`, "
"`vtkStringArray`, and `vtkVariantArray`. This was accomplished by adding "
"`(Set/Get)Typed(Component/Tuple)`, `GetVariantArray`, and `ShallowCopy` "
"methods to these classes, and change their implementation so that they use "
"`vtkBuffer` internally, instead of raw pointers, so that their "
"implementation is similar to `vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md:31
msgid ""
"Finally, all `vtkGenericDataArray` subclasses (except "
"`vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate`) now have a `GetVoidPointer()` method which warns "
"you when you use it because it performs a deep-copy internally. To that end, "
"`vtkSOADataArrayTemplate` no longer converts to `vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate` "
"when `GetVoidPointer()` is called."
msgstr ""
